<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How NoCostStack earns money and how that affects what we list.">
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>
    Some links on NoCostStack are affiliate links. If you click one and buy or sign up, we may earn
    a commission at no extra cost to you. Links that earn us money are marked as sponsored in the
    page code and noted on the page.
  </p>
  <h2>How this affects our content</h2>
  <p>
    Commissions do not decide which tools we list or how we describe them. We include free options
    whether or not they pay us anything, and we describe their limits plainly.
  </p>
  <h2>Other ways we may earn</h2>
  <p>We may also accept advertising or paid placements in the future. Any paid placement will be clearly labelled.</p>
</Base>
